# libmesa 2cbb076's twelve suites, as its own build.zig runs them with
# zig 0.15.2 (suites.sh zig ...). A build of ours must give the same.
# Under WASI store_test does not compile: wasi-libc has no mkdtemp (and
# store_sqlite.c's flock would fail at run time).
native pact-test pass
native ship-test pass
native lss-test pass
native bitset-test pass
native noun-test pass
native crypto-test pass
native ident-test pass
native azimuth-test pass
native engine-test pass
native store-test pass
native gall-test pass
native aes-siv-test pass
wasi pact-test pass
wasi ship-test pass
wasi lss-test pass
wasi bitset-test pass
wasi noun-test pass
wasi crypto-test pass
wasi ident-test pass
wasi azimuth-test pass
wasi engine-test pass
wasi store-test no-build
wasi gall-test pass
wasi aes-siv-test pass
